{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42772","headline":"重阳感怀 二 · 刘兼","name":"重阳感怀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"载花乘酒上高山，四望秋空八极宽。\n蜀国江山存不得，刘家豚犬取何难。\n张仪旧壁苍苔厚，葛亮荒祠古木寒。\n独对斜阳更惆怅，锦江东注似波澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}